  %  \item the deviation bound between a unique team-optimal solution and a unique NE.
    \item Does there exist a deviation bound between the team-optimal solution and the NE? 
    \item In which scenario is the team-optimal solution and the NE consistent?
    %the consistency between the team-optimal solution and the NE.  
