It satisfies the condition $K \leq \lfloor\frac{M}{S+1}\rfloor.$

The uncoded symbols transmitted as per \eqref{eq:trans1} are 
    $$W_0=X_1, W_1=X_4, W_2=X_7,
    W_3=X_{10}.$$
