\section{Evaluation of the Final System}

After selecting the most efficient and effective components for our RAG system, we evaluate the final Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) system with the hybrid retrieval approach on the full 24M document PubMed corpus. for \textit{retrieval effectiveness}, \textit{response time}, and \textit{answer correctness}.
%
We use a Linux server with an Intel Broadwell processor (16 cores, 30GB RAM) and an NVIDIA A30 GPU (24GB VRAM) for cross-encoder reranking.

