\begin{theorem}[Model Misspecification Robustness]
If the true optimal seeding function $S^*$ (minimizing true risk $R(S)$) is not in the hypothesis class $\mathcal{H}$ used by AlgoSelect, then the learned seeding function $\hat{S}_{ERM}$ (from ERM) satisfies, with probability $\ge 1-\delta$:
