\subsection{Generated Programs}
For completeness, we present the best heuristic found for BP, TSP, and FP in Listing~\ref{listing:best_program_bin},~\ref{listing:best_program_tsp}, and~\ref{listing:best_program_fp}. These heuristics are found by Phi 3.5 Instruct 3.8B, Granite 3.1 2B Instruct and Llama3.2 1B Instruct, respectively.

